hambeau-the-open-participation-in-doubt-two-stroke-penalty-golf">already the dominant story</a> of the 2026 Open. DeChambeau was handed a two-stroke penalty for improving the line of his swing by standing on long grass behind his ball on Royal Birkdaleâ€™s fifth hole during round two. The 32-year-old argued his case furiously, including insisting upon returning to the scene of the incident with the R&amp;Aâ€™s head of governance and a senior referee.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/jul/20/bryson-dechambeau-donald-trump-open-championshiup-penalty-golf-royal-birkdale">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;dSDjYJb0N1UTW3zC_A0I3183UefRQAYvmBTsU5AzXt8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;PnpKV9Wgg4zRw45V4kXUTRvUXM1mvxpesjyvvfli9owƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;snDo4xAKXgcHCRSumz-UYpiB1laFiNulRlcUo_DJFnIƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;KhAoQy9qoECKBddxhcZtzU36u7DEJhcn61H9rdLXVu0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;eCcOEGP-4tmw_cmvlSZSvv1tS6r6dFyu7-o8iN5LbSwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Sl_Gg1lsVUWWT8kDUXF7f34TPR-i5WKeZTJqXaQeX_Uƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;vVn66lbr1om-Hbb_r-IaZKb7qgrS7bhJOfzS3pi79OYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Yfdy8F8CH8FFIY3KEZ_CsR4BJq1j61mwyAjwNB4uz5wƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒeright